@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Future after MVP. Provider, advanced Sprint/review, or untrusted execution requirement retained as deferred.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
skinparam classBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam classBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam classHeaderBackgroundColor #17405A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam activityBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #17405A
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 40
hide empty members
title AFTER MVP — Provider communication and explicit application links
top to bottom direction
class "Application record\nDM-C16" as application {
  Progress
  intended material associations
}
class "Provider connection\nDM-C20" as connection {
  Provider identity
  access state
}
class "Email message / draft\nDM-C21" as message {
  Message/thread context
  content
  outcome
}
class "Calendar activity\nDM-C22" as activity {
  Time/zone
  provider mapping if applicable
}
class "Activity reminder\nDM-C23" as reminder {
  Activity
  recipient/time
  outcome
}
application -- message : explicit correspondence link
application -- activity : explicit activity link
connection -- message : connected account / capability
connection -- activity : selected provider mapping
activity -- reminder : notification intent
legend bottom
Solid lines: conceptual associations, not process steps.
Relationship bounds: document 03, section 3.
An unlabeled end is unspecified, not implicitly one.
Properties are semantic, not mandatory database fields.
endlegend
@enduml
